Description: Python bindings for the Zint barcode library
 zint-bindings exposes libzint, a barcode encoding library supporting over
 50 symbologies (QR Code, Data Matrix, PDF417, Aztec, Code 128, EAN, UPC,
 GS1 and many more), to Python as the module "zint".
 .
 This package builds the bindings against the system's libzint.
